# leasing-api-co-il — environment template
# Copy to `.env` and fill in real values. `.env` is git-ignored; this file is not.

# --- Supabase (used by stage-a agents + BI/Power BI layer on the read model) ---
# SUPABASE_URL: your project URL, e.g. https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY: the public "publishable" key (successor to the anon
# key). Safe for client-side exposure — protected by Row Level Security, NOT a
# secret. Never put the service_role key or DB password here.
SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
